   "design": "The inspector records hazards on a tablet form on site, which takes the location from GPS and attaches photos, so the report fields are filled where the hazard is seen instead of typed from paper notes at the office. Walking the area, talks, the recommendations, the check, sending and follow-up stay with the inspector.",
